##R² por analito
```{r}
funR2 <- function(pred, obs) {
  ss_res <- sum((obs - pred)^2)
  ss_tot <- sum((obs - mean(obs))^2)
  R2 <- 1 - (ss_res / ss_tot)
  return(R2)
}
```

